  "description": "Adds synthesis to CodeBrix.Audio: band-limited oscillators, noise, a waveguide plucked-string model, a multi-frame wavetable player, a 64-partial additive oscillator and a six-operator FM engine that generate sound instead of playing recorded samples, plus the creative effects a synth is expected to have - phaser, pitch shifter, wave folder, wave shaper, stereo simulator, bit crusher and gate. Usable on their own or as the sound generators and effects a Decent Sampler instrument asks for. Ships as a separate add-on so you only include the synthesis code when you actually need it.",
